  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "你需要什么："
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "items": [],
   "productIds": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "FRAKTA 弗拉塔 宜家蓝色储物袋、剪刀、尺子或者卷尺、缝纫机或胶水。"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "items": [],
   "productIds": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "1.沿着侧边将宜家蓝色储物袋剪开，铺平。将储物袋的肩带剪掉。"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "items": [],
   "productIds": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "2.尽量利用原有的缝合线。我们选择了利用顶部的缝合线。"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "items": [],
   "productIds": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "裁切出一个长方形（A），尺寸为16x15cm。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/1d/07/1d07b65ff990c9862fb4d4b7c22be477.jpg"
