  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "5.将小长方形（B）的侧边和底部缝合或黏在大长方形（A）上，确保在底部大长方形能够覆盖住小长方形。这做成了一个装信用卡的口袋。"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "items": [],
   "productIds": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "将成品对折。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/ff/e4/ffe4367e3181e382668ee256680aef02.jpg"
