   ],
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "将成品对折。",
     "text": "",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/ff/e4/ffe4367e3181e382668ee256680aef02.jpg",
     "href": null,
     "backgroundColor": null
    }
   ],
   "productIds": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "6.将成品对折，之前选择的缝合线放在顶部。由内向外翻转，用热熔胶枪或者缝纫机把它们缝合或者黏在一起，每边黏合的宽度大约为1cm。"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "items": [],
   "productIds": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "将成品压平，在手机袋的背后中间位置形成新的缝合线。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/35/ac/35aca325f4b20baa3316bd3950e5921d.jpg"
